      "review_description": "What can I say about Top House Solar - first of all what a great company!!! They really have top notch solutions backed by a very personal and sincere customer service. From start to finish the attention to our needs as well as the actual work itself was fantastic.Bryan spent the time to ensure the 13.2kW solution was the right one for us and Andrew ensured the team lead by Gary did an awesome job with the install. There were no problems getting a quick book in date once we decided to go and no sales pressure at all.This is my 4th house with solar dating back to 2010 so I know a little about solar, but the team didn't beat around the bush and gave honest sales and service - what more could you ask?A very happy customer and totally recommend to anyone.",
